  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3211.03 Regrooved Tires Prohibited. Pursuant to RSA 266:47, a vehicle shall be rejected if it is equipped with one or more regrooved tires.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes at Chapter Heading Saf-C 3200) #8915, eff 6-22-07, EXPIRED: 6-22-15\n\nNew. #10886, INTERIM, eff 7-16-15, EXPIRES: 1-12-16; ss by #11016, eff 1-6-16",
